# panel_cycle.script - Panel Cycle v3 task program (UR10 CB3, REAL CELL)
# Adaptive HRC Safety System FYP - Wu / Siniakov / Magila
#
# The ONE robot task program run identically under all three safety
# controllers (fixed_zone / dynamic_ssm / adaptive). Controllers act ONLY
# through the external speed slider + Dashboard stops - this script never
# changes between conditions. That invariance is the method.
#
# v3 CHANGE (2026-08-19): poses now come from data/taught_poses.json, the
# poses King freedrove on the REAL arm 2026-08-12. v2 used sim-authored
# joint angles from the URSim workcell; on hardware those are a DIFFERENT
# joint family (wrist1 at 90 deg vs the taught 270 deg cups-up family), so
# running v2 on the real cell swung the arm through an unvalidated
# configuration to reach angles that were never checked against the rig.
# Regenerate this file from the taught poses; do not hand-edit the angles.
#
# REACH NOTE: pose2_top is z=1.45 m above base. The 2.50 m ceiling target is
# NOT reachable from the current base height (measured live: cups-up max is
# z~1.51 with the elbow dead straight). Raising the base or lowering the
# structure is still open.
#
# STRUCTURE NOTE: plain statements only - NO def wrapper, NO trailing call.
# PolyScope inlines this file into its own generated program. The dashboard
# server wraps it on the fly for raw 30001 injection and prepends
# set_payload(1.7, [0,0,0.06]) - without that the shoulder trips C157A1 on
# the first acceleration.
#
# Five phases (matches src/hrc_safety/sim/scenario.py):
#   P1 LOAD       - park low, wait for panel weight   (monitored stop, not measured)
#   P2 TRANSIT    - lift panel toward ceiling         (SSM, measured)
#   P3 HAND-GUIDE - compliant hold at top             (measured)
#   P4 BOLT       - dead-still hold while human bolts (monitored stop, NOT measured)
#   P5 RELEASE    - lower back down                   (hold->SSM, measured)
# ...loop forever.

# Joint poses (rad) - TAUGHT ON THE REAL ARM, generated from data/taught_poses.json
q_low     = [-1.516600, 0.039020, -2.880180, -1.870970, 4.714890, -0.052800]
q_top     = [-1.498487, -1.203098, -0.634083, -2.874932, 4.710027, -0.072782]

# Conservative motion params (scaled live by the external speed slider).
acc = 0.8  # rad/s^2
vel = 0.6  # rad/s

while (True):
  # ---- P1 LOAD ----
  textmsg("P1 LOAD: at low pose, waiting for panel")
  movej(q_low, a=acc, v=vel)
  sleep(4.0)

  # ---- P2 TRANSIT ----
  textmsg("P2 TRANSIT: lifting panel to top")
  movej(q_top, a=acc, v=vel)

  # ---- P3 HAND-GUIDE ----
  textmsg("P3 HAND-GUIDE: compliant hold (hold still)")
  sleep(6.0)

  # ---- P4 BOLT ----
  textmsg("P4 BOLT: dead-still hold while human bolts")
  sleep(5.0)

  # ---- P5 RELEASE ----
  textmsg("P5 RELEASE: lowering to low pose")
  movej(q_low, a=acc, v=vel)
end
